  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## LLM privacy allowlist\n",
    "\n",
    "Only these items may be sent to the LLM:\n",
    "1. Risk probability\n",
    "2. Tenure\n",
    "3. Retrieved playbook clause\n",
    "4. Three global feature-importance signal names\n",
    "\n",
    "Do not send customer ID, the full customer row, raw demographic values, or unnecessary customer attributes. In particular, do not send gender, SeniorCitizen, Partner, or Dependents as retention explanations.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "top3_global_signal_names = [\n",
    "    'tenure',\n",
    "    'TotalCharges',\n",
    "    'Contract_Month-to-month'\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "llm_allowlist = {\n",
    "    'risk_probability': round(flagged_risk, 6),\n",
    "    'tenure': flagged_tenure,\n",
    "    'retrieved_clause': retrieved_clause,\n",
    "    'top3_global_feature_names': top3_global_signal_names\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "display(pd.DataFrame([llm_allowlist]))\n"
   ]
  },
